<h2>The Solution</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">A Custom-Built Survival Arena for Influencer Competition</p>
  <p>
    For Minecraft, I brought on Starfish Studios and managed the build of a
    custom-branded tournament world, integrating Xbox &amp; Verizon branding
    directly into the game environment.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">Competitive Mayhem on the High Seas</p>
  <p>
    For Sea of Thieves, I led creative and production for Bilge Rat Bingo &amp;
    Holiday Clash, turning the open-world pirate game into an unpredictable,
    competitive battleground.
  </p>
</div>

